{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 42, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the article, a link is provided, which allows readers to view the content in a different format. The article also features a Sudoku puzzle, which can be solved using the standard rules of the game, with a unique twist. The twist involves the numbers in the cells contained within grey lines, which must add up to the figures in the corner, adding an extra layer of complexity to the puzzle.\n\n\n \nAddition to the standard Sudoku rules, the numbers in the cells contained within grey lines have a special condition, where they must add up to the figures in the corner. This condition requires players to think strategically and make sure that the numbers they choose for each cell are not only correct according to the standard Sudoku rules but also satisfy the additional condition. The puzzle is designed to be challenging and requires a combination of logic and problem-solving skills.\n\n\n \nThe rules of the puzzle also state that no number can be repeated within each shape formed by grey lines. This means that players must be careful not to repeat any numbers within each shape, which can be a challenging task, especially as the puzzle progresses. The shapes formed by grey lines are a key part of the puzzle, and players must use them to their advantage in order to solve the puzzle successfully.\n\n\n \nThe completed puzzle can be found in next week's Observer Digital Edition, which provides a solution for those who are unable to solve it on their own. The Digital Edition is a useful resource for readers who want to access the content of the Observer in a digital format, and it includes a range of features, including puzzles, articles, and other interactive content. The Sudoku puzzle is just one example of the types of content that can be found in the Digital Edition.\n\n\n \nOverall, the Sudoku puzzle is a fun and challenging activity that requires a combination of logic, problem-solving skills, and strategic thinking. The unique twist on the standard Sudoku rules adds an extra layer of complexity to the puzzle, making it more engaging and entertaining for players. Whether you are a seasoned Sudoku player or just starting out, the puzzle is a great way to challenge yourself and have fun at the same time, and the solution can be found in next week's Observer Digital Edition for those who need it.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011118361726403236}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.2829512357711792}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0015241208020597696}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.034703001379966736}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.007189711090177298}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.00523612555116415}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.0001234931987710297}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.8602890968322754}, {"token": " which", "logprob": -1.2899800539016724}, {"token": " allows", "logprob": -0.32406085729599}, {"token": " readers", "logprob": -0.01257302425801754}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " view", "logprob": -0.0006872437661513686}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00013195598148740828}, {"token": " content", "logprob": -0.00014578233822248876}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0003053675754927099}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.01815113238990307}, {"token": " different", "logprob": -8.49926145747304e-05}, {"token": " format", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00462343730032444}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.005408298